    // INCHI✔️✔️:     /* the following types must exactly match types in inp_ATOM and inp_ATOM_STEREO */
    // INCHI✔️✔️:     /* Given parity from InChI, the order of stereo center neighbors is: */
    // INCHI✔️✔️:     /* 1. The stereocenter itself if the total number of neighbors is 3 (not 4) */
    // INCHI✔️✔️:     /* 2. Explicit H: non-isotopic, isotopic in order ofascending  atomic mass */
    // INCHI✔️✔️:     /*         Explicit H have already been sorted in this order */
    // INCHI✔️✔️:     /* 3. Normal neighboring atoms, atom numbers (=canonical numbers from InChI - 1) in ascending order */
    // INCHI✔️✔️:     /*         Normal neighboring atoms have already been sorted in this order */
